# Sweep 2b · 2.3a measurement B (map-sticky-60 §2 B): Release bench copy held at 120 (-MacPerfAB map120), T's case
# (WIN="1728 1029" WINY=0 LIBRARIAN=closed, -MapZoom 0.35, the sidebar 58 pt wider so the Map is ~1439 pt). Start the
# Metal System Trace ~15 s after the view-map line (it then covers the input). Same steps again with -PerfWhy YES, no
# trace, plus -PerfSampleAfter 1 and SAVEWAIT=90 (the default sampler only catches stalls over 40 ms; the big recording
# needs longer to write); read with why.py / map_split.py <rec> <rperf.txt> lib-hand.
sidebar    drag resize.sidebar 58 0 24
view-map   click toolbar.view.Map
rest       wait 18000
lib-hand   trackpad 1000,560 20 hold wobble
lib-pinch  pinch 1000,560 0.4 60 4
lib-pinch  pinch 1000,560 -0.3 60 4
lib-pinch  pinch 1000,560 0.4 60 4
lib-pinch  pinch 1000,560 -0.3 60 4
lib-hand   trackpad 1000,560 8 wobble
rest       wait 3000
